{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112083358096-1112_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261112121842\"/><p>葵涌發生爆竊案。今日（12日）凌晨3時01分，執法部門接報，指大圓街12至22號一工廈單位，懷疑有人撬開單位的後門。警員趕至現場，經初步調查，於上址一單位內拘捕一名姓葉(62歲)男子，涉嫌「企圖爆竊」及「爆竊」，他現正被扣留調查。調查顯示，上址另一個單位的門懷疑有被撬過的痕迹。據悉，人員在被捕男子身上起回一批金飾，金飾的價值有待點算。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:43:53.695415+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T00:33:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T11:29:09.649925+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:37:30.086336+00:00","content_hash":"4c9ed91555bd51238c5fa477de70840eb04d99f211f5904b0a0faa52ca13611b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:43:53.695415+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}